# Bagel and Schmear's Share: "{W}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Put a +1/+1 counter on up to one target creature. Draw a card. Activate only as a sorcery." On turn 1 Bot1 casts
# two Bagels with Mox Pearl's {W} and Mox Ruby's {R}, leaving only Mox Emerald's {G}: Share is not offered, since green cannot pay {W}. Bot2 casts an Ornithopter on turn 2. On turn 3
# Share cannot target Mox Emerald (not a creature); it puts its counter on Bot2's Ornithopter (0/2 to 1/2: an opponent's creature is a legal target) and draws, and the second Bagel's
# Share, activated with no target, only draws.

